# Hand-checked Sect Gear records from the Sect chapter of the 2.1 rulebook (303 pp, 2026-11-16), book pp.224-303.
# Pages come from the parsed entries. Soak is printed as shield glyphs: one glyph = 1 Soak on each Part the piece covers; "—" = no Soak.
# mods = the printed mods line. A mod switches on its data-model key unless it is listed in `off`; FEROCIOUS n and REACH n set numbers;
# an Affinity (LYRICAL ...) sets the affinity; a Grade word in the category (Refined ...) sets the grade; morph = every Profile of a MORPH weapon.
# bonus = extra weapon damage on top of the Profile's damage. id_name = the earlier catalog name, kept so the compendium id does not change.
# text markers: start / end slice the rules text out of the entry's joined text.
P = lambda **k: k
ARMS = lambda n: {'rarm': n, 'larm': n}
LEGS = lambda n: {'rleg': n, 'lleg': n}
ALL = lambda n: {'head': n, 'torso': n, **ARMS(n), **LEGS(n)}
